Score is a signed 32 bit integer variable, meaning the value can be no
larger than 2147483647.  In the recent nethack tournament, someone
spent enough time killing one of the riders that he exceed that value,
wrapping his score around to a negative number.  He then allowed
himself to be killed by a newt.  Technically, he didn't win the game
(by choice, not YASD), but he showed that you can reach MAX_SCORE and
then some.  Besides, when you ascend, your score is automatically
doubled, then you get more points for stuff you are carrying when you
ascend, so even reaching 1073741824, then ascending will also wrap the
score counter.

Myself, I have scored ~60M points in an extinctionist game with no
pets (ie, all kills my own).

